{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-25T08:58:20.789Z","data":{"text":"Task 3 is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented the dependency gate for change 080.\n\n**New module** `src/watcher/dependencies.ts`:\n- `readScopedDependencies` resolves the task scope and maps each scoped `package.json` to its sorted distinct names across the four dependency sections; unscoped files are never read.\n- `checkDependencies` compares the latest `measures` start event's baseline against current manifests, appends a `dependencies_added` event for new pairs (sorted by file then name, section moves excluded), and fails `denied_dependency` when an accepted ADR denies an added name, writing `- <name> in <file>: ADR <number>: <rule>` lines.\n\n**Wiring**: `gatherStartMeasures` adds `dependencies` (absent when empty); `checkBlockedFirst` now takes `TaskVerifyOptions` and runs the dependency check between blocked and missing-verify-path checks; the runner call is `checkBlockedFirst(verifyCtx, fail)` on one line, keeping `runner.ts` at 199 lines.\n\n**Types**: `dependencies_added` + `DependenciesAddedEventData` + optional `MeasuresEventData.dependencies`; `denied_dependency` in `RunTaskFailureReason` and `ELIGIBLE_AUTO_RETRY_REASONS` (after `verify_path_missing`).\n\n**Tests** `tests/denied-dependency.test.ts`: baseline scoped/outside-scope, allowed addition, denied dependency (event data, marker lines, no verify), superseded denial, and the loop's automatic retry asserting `priorFailureOutput` and prompt name `vue`.\n\n- Task verify `node --import tsx --test tests/denied-dependency.test.ts`: 6/6 pass.\n- Proposal verify `pnpm verify`: full suite, typechecks, build, and lint pass.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/080-architecture-decision-checks/.run/results/3.md`."}}
